00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:05.640
Now imagine that you close those gaps and you were able to lead with confidence.

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:11.740
Imagine that you were able to lead strategically and with a grand vision.

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:21.320
We developed the Big Leadership Energy Framework, a holistic approach to address the entire leader

