00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:29.840
Self-efficacy, self-advocacy, communication, and collaboration.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:38.000
collaboration. So are you imagining a world where you have put your foot on

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:43.760
the head of imposter syndrome and decided to lead from a genuine place

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:50.360
